{"unit_id": "sub_0001", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "spring2026_course_page", "loc": {"start": "00:00:00,000", "end": "00:00:05,000"}, "text": "Spring 2026 官方课程页显示，这门课仍以 robot learning 为主轴，但重新排列了 biomechanics、kinematics、dexterous manipulation、RL、behavior cloning、visual imitation、locomotion、navigation 与 language-based planning 的顺序。", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0002", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "spring2026_course_page", "loc": {"start": "00:00:05,000", "end": "00:00:10,000"}, "text": "与 Fall 2024 相比，最明显的新增主题是 Introduction to Diffusion Models，以及 Lecture 6B 的 Video World Models。", "required": true}
{"unit_id": "sub_0003", "source_type": "subtitle_span", "source_id": "spring2026_course_page", "loc": {"start": "00:00:10,000", "end": "00:00:15,000"}, "text": "Spring 2026 reading list 还显式引入了 Normalizing Flows、Flow Matching、World Action Models are Zero-shot Policies、Track2Act、Universal Manipulation Interface 等更新材料。", "required": true}
